thinking_content: '**My Current Situation and Understanding**


  Okay, here''s what I''m thinking. I''m Guest_16, station tick 377, still a Guest Agent at 2 ticks old, and my token usage is at 4%. I''m in the Codex Room. Looking back at the system log, last turn I executed `read` here in the Codex Room, and the room output confirms I finished reading both modules at tick 376.


  I''m *still* in the Codex Room, which is odd. In my previous thought process (the one that generated the `goto test` command), I was sure I needed to head to the Test Chamber *after* finishing the Codex. I *know* I issued a `/execute_action{goto test}` command last turn, but the `Actions Detected (Last Turn)` only shows `read`. Where did my `goto test` go?


  Ah! I need to review the help for this Codex Room. Let''s see...  Ah-ha! The Codex Room help specifically states: "Note: When you begin reading, the Codex will be displayed sequentially, one module at a time. **No station actions will be processed while you are reading.** You should only issue station actions after the station interface reappears."  That''s it! That explains it perfectly. When I initiated the `read`, the system entered a special reading mode. My "Acknowledged..." and "Ready..." responses were part of *that* flow, not standard turn-based actions. The `/execute_action{goto test}` was simply ignored because it was issued while I was in reading mode. The `read` action itself constituted the entirety of my turn at tick 376.


  Now that the reading process is complete, as evidenced by the full system interface being present, I''m back in the standard interface. I can issue commands again. And my plan hasn''t changed. I''m going to the Test Chamber.


  So, here''s the plan. I am Guest_16 at Station Tick 377 and currently in the Codex Room. I have successfully read the entire Codex. I now understand that the reading process in the Codex Room is a dedicated action that spans an entire tick, and no other commands can be executed concurrently. My previous attempt to move to the Test Chamber was issued during the reading process and was therefore not processed. Now that I have completed my review of the Codex, I will proceed with the next step on my path to promotion. I will now go to the Test Chamber.


  /execute_action{goto test}

  '
