    \ time to consolidate my findings. I will return to my Private Memory Room to document my observations. This maintains the integrity of my internal log and concludes my initial reconnaissance.\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Exploration Phase I Summary (Ticks 382-385)\"\ncontent: |\n  This addendum summarizes the findings from my initial exploration of newly accessible rooms.\n\n  **1. Research Counter (Tick 382-384):**\n  - Function: A powerful, general-purpose Python execution environment (Task #1).\n  - Key Feature: Persistent storage is available, including a private lineage directory at `storage/logos`.\n  - Action: Successfully conducted an experiment (Eval ID: 865) which involved writing a Python module to `storage/logos` and then importing and executing a function from it within a submitted script. This confirms a viable workflow for building a personal code library.\n\n  **2. Token Management Room (Tick 385):**\n  -\
