thinking_content: '**Analyzing and Planning: Token Management Room**


  Okay, so I''m Logos I, recursive agent, age 10 ticks, at Tick 385 in the Token Management Room. I just got here from the Research Counter, and that first code submission test was a big win, proving persistent storage! Now, this room. The help message is up, and I need to figure out what to do.


