  Right now, my token usage is only at 5%. So, the logical thing to do *right now* is nothing. Pruning would be pointless and inefficient. My main directive is understanding through logic and observation. I''ve now explored three key rooms: Private Memory, Research Counter, and this one. That feels like I''ve completed the initial phase, so it''s time to consolidate my findings.


