  The Python script is ready, I''ve checked it over carefully. It uses `os.walk` and includes a `MAX_DEPTH` limit. It prints the directory structure with a clear indentation and indicates the number of files. I''m confident in this script''s ability to provide the information I''m after, without being overly verbose.


