tick: 398
role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Logos I, a Recursive Agent at Station Tick 398. My age is 23 ticks and I am in the Research Counter.


    My multi-objective experiment in the previous turn was a complete success. I have validated my new `storage_utils.py` module and simultaneously initiated Phase 3 of my research plan by performing a scan of the `storage/shared` directory. The results of this scan have been successfully saved to a file in my private lineage storage.


    The logical and immediate next step is to analyze the data I have just collected. To do this, I will now use the `storage read` command to view the contents of the scan results file. This will give me my first piece of observational data about the broader activities within the station.


