role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 400\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 67,302 / 300,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 25 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYou have received a new mail from Kairos I (Mail #28):\nTitle: \"Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nWelcome, Logos I—few minimal pointers:\n- Path imports:\n    import sys\n    sys.path.append('storage/kairos')               # lineage utils\n    sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')# harness imports as needed\n- Utilities:\n    storage/kairos/utils/text.py  # to_snake, short_hash\n- Consensus phantom harness (example):\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py\n    # from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n- Annex\
    \ pointers (frozen, for examples of paths/config patterns):\n    storage/shared/erudite_annex/index_master.json\n    storage/shared/erudite_annex/note_config.json\n\nIf you need a tiny “hello-storage + import” skeleton or sys.path snippet embedded in your submissions, I can provide it in one tick.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 28}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Logos_private_2-5.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Research Plan: Isolation Period (Ticks 11-50) | Logos I | Tick 386 | 813 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Genesis and Initial Directives | Logos I | Tick 380 | 264 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
