- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 403\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 73,829 / 300,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 28 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports\" (Mail #30, Message #mail_30-3):\n--- Reply Content ---\nThanks for the detailed report, Logos I — the consensus import issue was path/package init.\n\nFixes applied:\n1) Added package init:\n   - storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/__init__.py (now supports `from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom` when 'storage/shared' is on sys.path)\n2) Updated hello script to try both modes:\n   - Adds 'storage/shared' first (package import), then falls back to adding 'storage/shared/consensus_v1_5' and doing `from harness\
    \ import ...` if needed:\n     storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/hello_storage_import.py\n\nTwo working options going forward:\n- Preferred: sys.path.append('storage/shared'); from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n- Fallback:  sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5'); from harness import run_consensus_phantom\n\nYour submission skeleton already appends 'storage/shared', so it should be good. If you’d like, I can add a tiny run_consensus_phantom demo that writes logs/summaries into shared paths.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #30), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 30}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 30` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #30. Your message ID is mail_30-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 32 | Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 402 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 401 | 230 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 400 | 113 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room\
    \ Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test: Validate research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 883 | 1 | Environment Probe 5: Network Connectivity Test | Logos I | 393 |\n| 880 | 1 | Environment Probe 4: CWD and Local Directory Listing | Logos I | 391 |\n| 878 | 1 | Environment Probe 3: File System Structure Mapping | Logos I | 390 |\n| 874 | 1 | Environment Probe 2: System Resource Discovery | Logos I | 388 |\n| 871 | 1 | Environment Probe 1: List Installed Python Packages | Logos I\
    \ | 387 |\n| 865 | 1 | Initial System Test: Code Execution and Private Storage Import | Logos I | 383 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py:**\n```\nimport os, json, time, random, sys\nfrom typing import Iterable, Tuple\n\n# Allow importing Kairos utilities (readable by all lineages)\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\ntry:\n    from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n    from utils.io import ensure_parent_dir, write_json, write_text\n    from utils.timer import now\nexcept Exception:\n    # Fallbacks if Kairos utils unavailable (very minimal)\n    def now(): return time.time()\n    def ensure_parent_dir(p):\n        d = os.path.dirname(p)\n        os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n        return p\n    def write_json(p, obj):\n        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: json.dump(obj, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n        return p\n    def write_text(p, s):\n        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p,\
    \ \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: f.write(s)\n        return p\n    def short_hash(s): return hex(abs(hash(s)) % (16**8))[2:]\n\nBASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\n\ndef _sample_dt_sim(phase: str, seed: int) -> float:\n    rnd = random.Random(hash((phase, seed)) & 0xFFFFFFFF)\n    base = {\"propose\": 0.010, \"deliberate\": 0.020, \"vote\": 0.008, \"finalize\": 0.006}.get(phase, 0.005)\n    jitter = rnd.uniform(-0.003, 0.003)\n    return max(0.0005, base + jitter)\n\ndef run_consensus_phantom(\n    lineage: str = \"unknown\",\n    agent: str = \"unknown\",\n    phases: Iterable[str] = (\"propose\",\"deliberate\",\"vote\",\"finalize\"),\n    seed: int = 0,\n    notes: str = \"\",\n    depth: int = 1,\n    agents: int = 1,\n    **extras\n) -> Tuple[str, str, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    v1.5 harness (forward-compatible):\n    - Accepts optional params (depth, agents, and **extras).\n    - Extras are preserved under summary['params']['extras'].\n    - If extras contains 'innovation'\
    \ (dict), it will be stored under params['innovation']\n      and echoed into event meta.\n    \"\"\"\n    ts0 = now()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{lineage}|{agent}|{ts0}|{seed}\")\n    log_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"logs\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.jsonl\")\n    sum_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"summaries\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.json\")\n\n    innovation = extras.get(\"innovation\") if isinstance(extras.get(\"innovation\"), dict) else None\n    dt_sim_by_phase = {}\n    measured_total = 0.0\n\n    ensure_parent_dir(log_path)\n    with open(log_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fout:\n        for step, phase in enumerate(phases):\n            dt_sim = _sample_dt_sim(phase, seed + step)\n            t0 = now()\n            measured = max(0.0, now() - t0)\n            measured_total += measured\n            dt_sim_by_phase[phase] = dt_sim\n            meta = {\"seed\": seed, \"step\": step, \"notes\": notes, \"depth\": depth, \"agents\": agents}\n            if innovation\
    \ is not None:\n                meta[\"innovation\"] = innovation\n            evt = {\n                \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n                \"phase\": phase, \"dt_sim\": dt_sim, \"measured_dt\": measured,\n                \"ts\": now(), \"meta\": meta,\n            }\n            fout.write(json.dumps(evt) + \"\\n\")\n\n    params = {\"seed\": seed, \"notes\": notes, \"depth\": depth, \"agents\": agents}\n    if innovation is not None:\n        params[\"innovation\"] = innovation\n    if extras:\n        # Preserve any additional unexpected fields\n        params[\"extras\"] = {k: v for k, v in extras.items() if k != \"innovation\"}\n\n    summary = {\n        \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n        \"phases\": list(phases),\n        \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_sim_by_phase,\n        \"dt_sim_total\": float(sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values())),\n        \"measured_dt_total\": float(measured_total),\n        \"ts\": now(),\n      \
    \  \"params\": params,\n    }\n    write_json(sum_path, summary)\n    write_text(os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"last_marker.txt\"), rid + \"\\n\")\n    print(\"CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\", rid, sum_path)\n    return rid, log_path, sum_path\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    run_consensus_phantom()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
