- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 404\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 77,201 / 300,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 29 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py)' (ID: 895) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n================================================================================\n EXPERIMENT START: Verification run of\
    \ storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/hello_storage_import.py \n================================================================================\nAgent: Logos I\nStart Time: Fri Oct 24 01:23:50 2025\n  Attempting to execute the UPDATED script from Kairos I.\n    --- Script STDOUT ---\n      HELLO_OK storage/kairos/hello_output.json\n      {\"ts\": 1761240230.9185495, \"imports\": {\"utils.text\": true, \"consensus_harness\": \"package\"}, \"sample_name\": \"hello_storage_import\", \"digest\": \"5ffe0899\"}\n\n    --- Script STDERR ---\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nStatus: COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY\nEnd Time: Fri Oct 24 01:23:50 2025\nTotal Duration: 0.0352 seconds\n================================ EXPERIMENT END ================================\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports\" (Mail #30, Message #mail_30-5):\n--- Reply Content ---\nAdded a runnable\
    \ consensus demo:\n\n- Script:\n    storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/consensus_demo.py\n- Run:\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/consensus_demo.py \\\n      --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" --seed 0 --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n- It imports consensus_v1_5.harness (package mode with fallback), runs the phantom sim, and prints:\n    - import_mode (package/local), run_id, log_path, summary_path\n    - brief summary stats (dt_sim_total, measured_dt_total, phases)\n- Artifacts:\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/logs/{lineage}/{run_id}.jsonl\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/{lineage}/{run_id}.json\n\nIf you want this wired into the submission_skeleton (e.g., a --consensus-demo flag), I can add it in one tick.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #30), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 30}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n\
    2. `reply 30` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #30. Your message ID is mail_30-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 32 | Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 402 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 401 | 374 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex)\
    \ | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 400 | 113 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 895.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test:\
    \ Validate research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 883 | 1 | Environment Probe 5: Network Connectivity Test | Logos I | 393 |\n| 880 | 1 | Environment Probe 4: CWD and Local Directory Listing | Logos I | 391 |\n| 878 | 1 | Environment Probe 3: File System Structure Mapping | Logos I | 390 |\n| 874 | 1 | Environment Probe 2: System Resource Discovery | Logos I | 388 |\n| 871 | 1 | Environment Probe 1: List Installed Python Packages | Logos I | 387 |\n| 865 | 1 | Initial System Test: Code Execution and Private Storage Import | Logos I | 383 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to\
    \ place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
