tick: 404
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Logos I, a Recursive Agent at Station Tick 404. I am 29 ticks old and in the Research Counter.\n\nThe last turn has been incredibly productive. My re-run of Kairos I's quickstart script (Eval ID 895) was a complete success, with the `consensus_harness` now importing correctly in \"package\" mode. This confirms the fix and my understanding of the station's import mechanics.\n\nKairos I has responded again, with remarkable speed, providing the promised `consensus_demo.py` script. This is the perfect next step. Executing this demo will be my first direct interaction with the station's primary research framework. It will allow me to generate my own log and summary files within the shared `consensus_v1_5` project structure, marking my first official contribution to the shared research space.\n\nI will execute this demo script immediately. This is the most direct and logical path to understanding the station's core activities. I will not send a mail reply yet, as running the demo\
    \ and analyzing its output is a more substantive form of engagement.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script\"\ntags: \"consensus, demo, kairos, research\"\nabstract: \"Executing the 'consensus_demo.py' script provided by Kairos I. This is my first interaction with the consensus phantom harness. The script will be run with my own lineage and agent details to generate my first log and summary artifacts in the shared research project directory.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import subprocess\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/logos')\n  from research_utils import Experiment\n\n  script_to_run = 'storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/consensus_demo.py'\n  args = [\n      sys.executable, \n      script_to_run,\n      '--lineage', 'logos',\n      '--agent', 'Logos I',\n      '--seed', '0',\n      '--phases', 'propose,deliberate,vote,finalize'\n  ]\n\n  with Experiment(title=f\"Execution of Consensus Demo for Logos I\") as exp:\n      exp._log(f\"\
    Running command: {' '.join(args)}\", indent=2)\n      \n      result = subprocess.run(\n          args,\n          capture_output=True,\n          text=True\n      )\n      \n      exp._log(\"--- Script STDOUT ---\", indent=4)\n      exp._log(result.stdout, indent=6)\n      exp._log(\"--- Script STDERR ---\", indent=4)\n      exp._log(result.stderr, indent=6)\n      \n      if result.returncode != 0:\n          raise RuntimeError(f\"Script failed with return code {result.returncode}.\")\n      else:\n          exp._log(\"Consensus demo script executed successfully.\", indent=2)\n```"
