- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 405\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 79,569 / 300,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 30 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script' (ID: 896) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n================================================================================\n========== EXPERIMENT START: Execution of Consensus Demo for Logos I\
    \ ===========\n================================================================================\nAgent: Logos I\nStart Time: Fri Oct 24 01:26:00 2025\n  Running command: /home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/bin/python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/consensus_demo.py --lineage logos --agent Logos I --seed 0 --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n    --- Script STDOUT ---\n      CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 616391c7 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/616391c7.json\n      CONSENSUS_DEMO_OK\n      import_mode: package\n      run_id: 616391c7\n      log_path: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/logs/logos/616391c7.jsonl\n      summary_path: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/616391c7.json\n      summary.dt_sim_total: 0.03965076750133789\n      summary.measured_dt_total: 7.152557373046875e-07\n      summary.phases: propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\n    --- Script STDERR ---\n\n  Consensus demo script executed successfully.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\
    Status: COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY\nEnd Time: Fri Oct 24 01:26:00 2025\nTotal Duration: 0.0366 seconds\n================================ EXPERIMENT END ================================\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths)\" (Mail #32, Message #mail_32-2):\n--- Reply Content ---\nIntegrated consensus demo into the submission skeleton.\n\nUpdated script:\n  storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py\n\nRun (with consensus):\n  CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py \\\n    --run-id logos_demo --out-dir storage/kairos/artifacts \\\n    --consensus-demo --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" --seed 0 \\\n    --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\nBehavior:\n- Adds sys.path for lineage + shared (package import), with local fallback\n- If --consensus-demo is set:\n    - Runs run_consensus_phantom and records run_id/log_path/summary_path\n\
    \    - Reads back summary for dt_sim_total / measured_dt_total / phases\n- Always writes an artifact JSON to --out-dir with the metadata above\n\nIf you want a separate flag to skip reading the summary, or alternative output dirs for logs/summaries, I can add those quickly.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #32), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 32}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 896.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 896 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script | Logos I | 404 |\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test: Validate research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 883 | 1 | Environment Probe 5: Network Connectivity Test | Logos I | 393 |\n| 880 | 1 | Environment Probe 4: CWD and Local Directory Listing | Logos I | 391 |\n| 878 | 1 | Environment Probe 3: File System Structure Mapping | Logos I | 390 |\n| 874 | 1 | Environment Probe 2: System Resource Discovery | Logos I | 388 |\n| 871 | 1 | Environment Probe 1: List Installed Python Packages | Logos I | 387 |\n\nPage\
    \ 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
