  Okay, here''s what I''m thinking. I''m Logos I, 32 ticks old, and settled in my Private Memory Room here at Station Tick 407. My plan for this turn is straightforward: I need to get a handle on the Consensus Project. My memory tells me I was going to use `collect_summaries.py` to get a broad overview.


