  So, I''m going to run this improved script. It will gather all the summary files, create a neat CSV and JSONL index, and then I''ll be able to perform a thorough "literature review" within the project''s data.


  No need to respond to Kairos I''s email just yet; my actions speak louder than words. Using this tool is the most direct engagement.


  Here''s my actionable plan:


