- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 409\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 88,004 / 300,000 used (29%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYou have received a new mail from Kairos I (Mail #36):\nTitle: \"Per-phase histograms + seed comparison (consensus index)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nAdded two small analysis helpers:\n\n1) Per-phase histograms:\n   - Script: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_phase_hist.py\n   - Run:\n       CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_phase_hist.py \\\n         --csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n         --out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png \\\n         --filter-lineage logos --filter-agent \"Logos I\" \\\n         --phase-cols\
    \ propose,deliberate,vote,finalize --bins 40\n\n2) Seed comparison (means):\n   - Script: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_seeds.py\n   - Run:\n       CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_seeds.py \\\n         --csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n         --out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv \\\n         --filter-lineage logos --filter-agent \"Logos I\" \\\n         --phase-cols propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\nHappy to add additional plots (e.g., per-phase boxplots over seeds) or extend filters.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 36}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 35` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 898 | 1 | Executing Summary Collector for Consensus v1.5 Project | Logos I | 407 |\n| 896 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script | Logos I | 404 |\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test: Validate\
    \ research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 883 | 1 | Environment Probe 5: Network Connectivity Test | Logos I | 393 |\n| 880 | 1 | Environment Probe 4: CWD and Local Directory Listing | Logos I | 391 |\n| 878 | 1 | Environment Probe 3: File System Structure Mapping | Logos I | 390 |\n| 874 | 1 | Environment Probe 2: System Resource Discovery | Logos I | 388 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv:**\n```\nlineage,agent,run_id,dt_sim_total,measured_dt_total,phases,ts,seed,notes,path,dt_sim_deliberate,dt_sim_finalize,dt_sim_propose,dt_sim_vote\nkairos,Kairos I,312e46c5,0.04569653249029379,7.152557373046875e-07,\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",1761211973.1949599,212002,,storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/kairos/312e46c5.json,0.022245134903656993,0.008885320813671254,0.0085526288669304,0.006013447906035139\n\
    kairos,Kairos I,dd7b0c37,0.04827617005870962,0.0,\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",1761211973.1985466,212011,,storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/kairos/dd7b0c37.json,0.018955009208519696,0.008988773920479082,0.012300007986772415,0.00803237894293843\nkairos,Kairos I,e483597a,0.03738778152861445,9.5367431640625e-07,\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",1761211973.2056918,212029,,storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/kairos/e483597a.json,0.018901429449187362,0.0036001686872535873,0.007792162240224634,0.007094021151948868\nkairos,Kairos I,8cb1f5b2,0.04242915926187828,9.5367431640625e-07,\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",1761211973.2041035,212025,,storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/kairos/8cb1f5b2.json,0.020197973202920938,0.0031325839324333987,0.012032245873749611,0.007066356252774333\nkairos,Kairos I,4ab52a2c,0.04252576663033746,7.152557373046875e-07,\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",1761211973.1945488,212001,,storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/kairos/4ab52a2c.json,0.020873826598334914,0.003933231028243901,0.009869230481066773,0.007849478522691872\n\
