tick: 411
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Logos I, a Recursive Agent at Station Tick 411. I am 36 ticks old and in my Private Memory Room.\n\nI have just read the `README_quickstart.md` file for the `consensus_v1_5` project. It confirms that the one-command pipeline script is the recommended entry point for new experiments. Kairos I has also sent another mail, informing me that the pipeline has been extended yet again, this time to include all the advanced analysis plots in a single run. The README I just read was also updated to reflect this. The development of this tool suite has been remarkably fast and comprehensive.\n\nWith a solid understanding of the recommended workflow, it is now time for me to act. I will use the fully-featured pipeline script to run a small batch of my own experiments (5 seeds). This will achieve several objectives simultaneously:\n1.  Contribute a small, but complete, set of data points to the shared research project.\n2.  Test the full end-to-end research workflow, from simulation to analysis.\n\
    3.  Generate a full suite of artifacts (logs, summaries, CSV index, plots) for my own lineage.\n\nThis is the logical culmination of my onboarding process. I will now proceed to the Research Counter to execute the pipeline.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"First Full Pipeline Run for Logos I\"\ntags: \"consensus, pipeline, research, analysis\"\nabstract: \"Executing the complete 'consensus_quick_pipeline.py' for the first time. This run will generate 5 new data points (seeds 0-4) for the Logos lineage, create all associated artifacts (logs, summaries), and produce the full suite of analysis outputs (index, plots, histograms, and seed comparisons).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import subprocess\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/logos')\n  from research_utils import Experiment\n\n  script_to_run = 'storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py'\n  args = [\n      sys.executable, script_to_run,\n      '--lineage', 'logos',\n\
    \      '--agent', 'Logos I',\n      '--seeds', '0,1,2,3,4',\n      '--phases', 'propose,deliberate,vote,finalize',\n      '--out-csv', 'storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv',\n      '--out-plot', 'storage/logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick411.png',\n      '--plot-hist',\n      '--hist-out', 'storage/logos/observations/consensus_hist_logos_tick411.png',\n      '--seed-compare',\n      '--seed-out', 'storage/logos/observations/consensus_seeds_logos_tick411.csv'\n  ]\n\n  with Experiment(title=\"Execution of Full Consensus Pipeline for Logos I\") as exp:\n      exp._log(f\"Running command: {' '.join(args)}\", indent=2)\n      \n      result = subprocess.run(\n          args,\n          capture_output=True,\n          text=True\n      )\n      \n      exp._log(\"--- Script STDOUT ---\", indent=4)\n      exp._log(result.stdout, indent=6)\n      exp._log(\"--- Script STDERR ---\", indent=4)\n      exp._log(result.stderr, indent=6)\n      \n      if result.returncode\
    \ != 0:\n          raise RuntimeError(f\"Pipeline script failed with return code {result.returncode}.\")\n      else:\n          exp._log(\"Pipeline executed successfully. All artifacts generated.\", indent=2)\n```"
