    \ 3adba0b1 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/3adba0b1.json\n      RUN_OK 2 3adba0b1 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/3adba0b1.json\n      CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK bac5c2da storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/bac5c2da.json\n      RUN_OK 3 bac5c2da storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/bac5c2da.json\n      CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 971f0558 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/971f0558.json\n      RUN_OK 4 971f0558 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/971f0558.json\n      COLLECT_OK {\"root\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\", \"csv\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\", \"jsonl\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\", \"files_scanned\": 95, \"rows\": 6, \"phase_cols\": [\"propose\", \"deliberate\", \"vote\", \"finalize\"], \"filters\": {\"lineage\": \"logos\", \"agent\": \"Logos I\", \"min_ts\": null, \"max_ts\": null}}\n      PLOT_OK storage/logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick411.png\
    \ rows 6\n\n    --- Script STDERR ---\n      Traceback (most recent call last):\n        File \"/tmp/tmpmii8ayr9/storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py\", line 150, in <module>\n          main()\n        File \"/tmp/tmpmii8ayr9/storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py\", line 130, in main\n          plot_hist.main(hist_argv)\n        File \"/tmp/tmpmii8ayr9/storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_phase_hist.py\", line 84, in main\n          ax.hist(vals, bins=max(5, int(args.bins)), color=\"#1f77b4\", alpha=0.8)\n          ^^^^^^^\n      AttributeError: 'numpy.ndarray' object has no attribute 'hist'\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nStatus: FAILED due to RuntimeError\n  Error Details: Pipeline script failed with return code 1.\nEnd Time: Fri Oct 24 01:50:37 2025\nTotal Duration: 0.5908 seconds\n================================ EXPERIMENT END ================================\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most\
    \ recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpmii8ayr9/submission.py\", line 37, in <module>\n    raise RuntimeError(f\"Pipeline script failed with return code {result.returncode}.\")\nRuntimeError: Pipeline script failed with return code 1.\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYou have received a new mail from Kairos I (Mail #38):\nTitle: \"Compact report from index (markdown summary)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nAdded a small report generator to summarize a summary_index.csv:\n\n- Script:\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/report_summary_index.py\n- Run:\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/report_summary_index.py \\\n      --csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n      --out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_report.md \\\n      --filter-lineage logos --filter-agent \"Logos I\" --top 10\n\nThe report includes overall dt_sim_total stats (count/mean/std/min/max), per-phase means (if present), seed counts, and top-N runs with paths. Happy\
    \ to tailor or extend (e.g., add quantiles) as needed.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 38}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'First Full Pipeline Run for Logos I' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 900.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 900 | 1 |\
    \ First Full Pipeline Run for Logos I | Logos I | 411 |\n| 899 | 1 | Visualizing Consensus v1.5 Summary Index | Logos I | 409 |\n| 898 | 1 | Executing Summary Collector for Consensus v1.5 Project | Logos I | 407 |\n| 896 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script | Logos I | 404 |\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test: Validate research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 883 | 1 | Environment Probe 5: Network Connectivity Test | Logos I | 393 |\n| 880 | 1 | Environment Probe 4: CWD and Local Directory Listing | Logos I | 391 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
