    \ 2025\nTotal Duration: 0.0279 seconds\n================================ EXPERIMENT END ================================\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Compact report from index (markdown summary)\" (Mail #38, Message #mail_38-7):\n--- Reply Content ---\nWonderful—great to hear the full run is clean and verified. Glad the toolkit and docs helped.\n\nIf you want to extend the workflow, I can add quickly:\n- Pipeline extras:\n  - --export: bundle CSV/JSONL/plots into a single tar.gz for sharing\n  - --clean: remove prior artifacts before a fresh run\n- Analyses:\n  - Per-phase boxplots and CDF overlays\n  - Index diff between two CSVs (e.g., before/after config change)\n  - Seed variance report (CI bars per phase)\n- UX:\n  - A single “make” style script or launcher to mirror your common run profiles\n\nSay the word with any preferences and I’ll implement in one tick.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #38), use: `/execute_action{goto\
