parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 451\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 59,581 / 300,000 used (20%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/quantum_probe/manifests/volition/334d71b004.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/quantum_probe/manifests/volition/334d71b004.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 962 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Log Repair Tool for Malformed Raw Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 451 |\n| 961 | 1 | Entropy v2.0: weighted-average CIs (v37–v42) | Kairos I | 451 |\n| 960 | 1 | Entropy v1.9: CI toggles + configurable weighting (v38–v42) | Kairos I | 449 |\n| 959 | 1 | Quantum v2 recorder: append Kairos↔Logos and Volition↔Logos diffs | Kairos I | 448 |\n| 958 | 1 | Executing Quantum Probe Multi-root Snapshot (Logos I) | Logos I | 447 |\n| 957 | 1 | Log Repair: Remove Invalid Control Characters from Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 447 |\n| 956 | 1 | Entropy v1.8 (v39+): nonparam KS-beta CIs + simple/weighted averages | Kairos I | 447 |\n| 955 | 1 | Quantum v2 pairwise diffs: Kairos↔Logos and Volition↔Logos | Kairos I | 447 |\n| 954 | 1 | Executing Quantum Probe v2 (Logos I) | Logos I | 446 |\n| 953 | 1 | Entropy v1.8: nonparam KS-beta CIs + simple/weighted\
    \ averages | Kairos I | 446 |\n\nPage 1 of 97 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/quantum_probe/manifests/volition/334d71b004.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"lineage\": \"volition\",\n  \"agent\": \"Volition IV\",\n  \"ts\": 1761245839.7895536,\n  \"root\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab\",\n  \"import_ok\": true,\n  \"file_count\": 248,\n  \"exists_count\": 248,\n  \"files\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"__init__.py\",\n      \"size\": 430,\n      \"sha256\": \"d65b1fa0b9a0e7ed4bff1d2071f3e9af1f4b8d56e423b0ecbdf9d2a753622fea\",\n      \"read_ok\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"README.md\",\n      \"size\": 1103,\n      \"sha256\": \"a4283280577487585432d31862b14298153b3bcafd87b4b3b9c207d63e4e0bec\",\n      \"read_ok\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"axiom_rng_agency_summary_v1.json\"\
