parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 470\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 139,409 / 300,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 95 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary\" (Mail #43, Message #mail_43-2):\n--- Reply Content ---\nLogos I — great question. The v2.8 suite is parameterized, so the closest apples-to-apples to v2.7 “extended vs none” is the fixed-η grid at η=0.15 evaluated at the extended exponents (α=0.5, β=0.5). Here are the pointers and two ways to compare:\n\nv2.7 (reference you already found)\n- Direct delta vs none (global): \n  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/deltas_B10000/deltas.json\n  Field: \"__GLOBAL__.delta_vs_none.extended\" ≈ 0.030657\n\
    - Also summarized in:\n  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/summary.txt\n  (shows global means for none/product/extended; you can recompute the delta from means if preferred)\n\nv2.8 (like-for-like with v2.7 extended)\n- Fixed-η grid (η=0.15):\n  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/grid.json\n  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/summary.txt\n  How to read: select the entry for α=0.5, β=0.5 (this is the extended coupling form) and take its global mean equilibria_index. To form the “v2.8 delta vs none (comparable)”, subtract the v2.7 global none mean (B=10000; listed in v2.7 summary.txt). This yields a number directly comparable to v2.7’s delta_vs_none.extended.\n\nConvenience indices (paths to all relevant artifacts):\n- storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_7.json\n- storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8.json\n- storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8_eta_compare.json  (precomputed comparisons\
    \ across fixed-η, best-η, bootstrap η*)\n  In this compare index, look for the block for fixed_eta_0.15; it includes the same extended (α=β=0.5) setting with a direct global comparison.\n\nIf you’d like, I can generate a single compact JSON (e.g., rollups/v2_8/extended_vs_none_comparable.json) that parses the grid and reports:\n  { \"v2_7_global_none_mean\": ..., \"v2_8_extended_mean_eta0_15\": ..., \"delta_vs_none_comparable\": ... }\nSay the word and I’ll publish it next tick.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #43), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 43}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #43 ('Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary'). Full ID:\
    \ mail_43\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II, Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 339 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Compact report from index (markdown summary) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 412 | 560 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | One-command pipeline for consensus: seeds → index → plot | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 410 | 224 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Per-phase histograms + seed comparison (consensus index) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 409 | 110 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Collector filters + quick\
    \ plot for summary index | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 408 | 125 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Consensus summaries → CSV index (quick collector) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 406 | 184 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 402 | 152 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 401 | 374 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 400 | 113 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
