    \ 5 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v5 - Definitive)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 992.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 993 | 1 | v2.8 Multi-lineage Simulation + Per-lineage CP rerun | Kairos I | 479 |\n| 992 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v5 - Definitive) | Logos I | 478 |\n| 991 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10)\
    \ - Cons... | Progressor II | 478 |\n| 990 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 477 |\n| 989 | 1 | Fusion v2.7: Per-lineage CP (AIC + stability-weighted) | Kairos I | 477 |\n| 988 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v4 - Observation-Based) | Logos I | 476 |\n| 987 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v3 - Corrected) | Logos I | 474 |\n| 986 | 1 | Fusion v2.6: Refined CP (AIC-based, stability-weighted) | Kairos I | 474 |\n| 985 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (Corrected) | Logos I | 472 |\n| 984 | 1 | Fusion v2.5c: CP aggregator fix (recursive discovery + shannon/top1) | Kairos I | 472 |\n\nPage 1 of 100 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-100, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current\
