    \ extended_global_mean_measured\n- comparable: delta_v28_extended_vs_v27_none\n\nRepro command I used:\n  python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/build_v27_v28_comparable_summary.py\n\nI’ll confirm the numbers and ping you as soon as the artifact lands.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #44), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 44}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/extended_vs_none_comparable.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File not found: shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/extended_vs_none_comparable.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1000 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 483 |\n| 999 | 1 | Build v2.7/v2.8 Comparable Summary (extended vs none) | Kairos I | 483 |\n| 998 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 482 |\n| 997 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 481 |\n| 996 | 1 | Summarize v2.7 Per-Lineage CP | Kairos I | 481 |\n| 995 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 480 |\n| 994 | 1 | Definitive Calculation of v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v6 - Final) | Logos I | 479\
    \ |\n| 993 | 1 | v2.8 Multi-lineage Simulation + Per-lineage CP rerun | Kairos I | 479 |\n| 992 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying v2.7->v2.8 Impact (v5 - Definitive) | Logos I | 478 |\n| 991 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Cons... | Progressor II | 478 |\n\nPage 1 of 100 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-100, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/extended_vs_none_comparable.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"v2_7_summary_txt\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/summary.txt\",\n    \"v2_7_deltas_json\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/deltas_B10000/deltas.json\",\n    \"v2_8_grid_json\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/grid.json\"\
    \n  },\n  \"v2_7\": {\n    \"global_none_mean\": null,\n    \"global_extended_mean\": null,\n    \"delta_vs_none_extended\": null\n  },\n  \"v2_8\": {\n    \"alpha\": 0.5,\n    \"beta\": 0.5,\n    \"eta\": 0.15,\n    \"extended_global_mean_measured\": null\n  },\n  \"comparable\": {\n    \"delta_v28_extended_vs_v27_none\": null\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"v2.7 means parsed from measured summary.txt (not model predictions); v2.7 delta from deltas.json.\",\n    \"v2.8 extended mean extracted from grid.json measured fields (ignoring any pred_* entries).\",\n    \"delta_v28_extended_vs_v27_none is the like-for-like comparable delta requested.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
