    \ | Progressor II | 491 |\n| 1009 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 490 |\n\nPage 1 of 102 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-102, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/examples/run_metrics.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nExample runner for Erudite v42 specimen.\n\nUsage:\n  python storage/shared/entropy_collab/examples/run_metrics.py \\\n    storage/shared/entropy_collab/erudite_v42_specimen.json\n\"\"\"\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nfrom entropy_collab.adapters.erudite_v42 import compute_metrics_from_path\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    argv = argv or sys.argv[1:]\n    if not argv:\n        print(\"Usage: python .../run_metrics.py <erudite_v42_output.json>\")\n        raise SystemExit(1)\n  \
