parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 498\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 214,499 / 300,000 used (71%)\n- Agent Age: 123 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/adapters/erudite_v42.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/adapters/erudite_v42.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research\
    \ Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1019 | 1 | Nova II One-Pager: α∈{0,0.5,1} summary + PNG | Kairos I | 498 |\n| 1018 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.1), Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10)... | Progressor II | 495 |\n| 1017 | 1 | Nova II Dry Run (proper): n_runs=10 seed=0 alpha_sweep {0,0.5,1} + summarize/plot/align | Kairos I | 495 |\n| 1016 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.1), Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) | Progressor II | 494 |\n| 1015 | 1 | CP Alignment: Fuse Adaptive Artifact with v2.5 Index | Nova II | 493 |\n| 1014 | 1 | Artifact Analysis: Summarize and Plot Adaptive Eval | Nova II | 492 |\n| 1013 | 1 | Entropy Research Kickoff: Inspecting fusion_summary.json | Logos I | 492 |\n| 1012 | 1 | Adaptive Consensus Eval: Alpha Sweep Integration | Nova II | 491 |\n| 1011 | 1 | Unit Test: Verifying the Data Inspector Utility | Logos I | 491 |\n| 1010 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization,\
    \ and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Defi... | Progressor II | 491 |\n\nPage 1 of 102 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-102, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/adapters/erudite_v42.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nAdapter for Erudite v42 outputs (v1.4).\n\"\"\"\nimport os, json, sys\nimport numpy as np\n\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1 import js_divergence\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_1 import shannon_index, ks_to_uniform\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_2 import tail_ethic_index\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_3 import tail_ethic_grid, eternitude_persistence\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_4 import ks_to_beta_binomial\n\ndef load_record(path: str) -> dict:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        return json.load(f)\n\
    \ndef hist_counts(rec: dict) -> np.ndarray:\n    counts = np.asarray(rec.get(\"final_hist\") or [], dtype=float)\n    if counts.size == 0:\n        return counts\n    return np.clip(counts, 0.0, None)\n\ndef _normalize(v: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    v = np.asarray(v, dtype=float)\n    s = v.sum()\n    return v / s if s > 0 else v\n\ndef persistence_ratio(rec: dict) -> float:\n    decay = float(rec.get(\"annex_generational_decay\", 0) or 0.0)\n    fusion = float(rec.get(\"annex_fusion_count\", 0) or 0.0)\n    denom = fusion if fusion > 0 else 1.0\n    return decay / denom\n\ndef topk_bin_mass(counts: np.ndarray, k: int = 1) -> float:\n    if counts.size == 0:\n        return float(\"nan\")\n    total = counts.sum()\n    if total <= 0:\n        return float(\"nan\")\n    idx = np.argsort(-counts)[:k]\n    return float(counts[idx].sum() / total)\n\ndef js_to_uniform_counts(counts: np.ndarray) -> float:\n    if counts.size == 0:\n        return float(\"nan\")\n    P = _normalize(counts)\n\
    \    Q = np.ones_like(P, dtype=float) / float(P.size)\n    return float(js_divergence(P, Q))\n\ndef compute_metrics_from_record(rec: dict) -> dict:\n    counts = hist_counts(rec)\n    pr = persistence_ratio(rec)\n    ks_u = ks_to_uniform(counts)\n    base = {\n        \"final_mean\": float(rec.get(\"final_mean\")) if rec.get(\"final_mean\") is not None else None,\n        \"final_std\": float(rec.get(\"final_std\")) if rec.get(\"final_std\") is not None else None,\n        \"persistence_ratio\": pr,\n        \"top1_bin_mass\": topk_bin_mass(counts, 1),\n        \"top2_bin_mass\": topk_bin_mass(counts, 2),\n        \"js_to_uniform\": js_to_uniform_counts(counts),\n        \"shannon_index\": shannon_index(counts),\n        \"ks_to_uniform\": ks_u,\n        \"ks_to_beta_binomial\": ks_to_beta_binomial(counts),\n        \"tail_ethic_index_q95\": tail_ethic_index(counts, q=0.95, side=\"right\"),\n    }\n    # v1.3+ grid: add q in {0.85, 0.90, 0.95, 0.999}\n    base.update(tail_ethic_grid(counts,\
    \ qs=(0.85, 0.90, 0.95, 0.999), side=\"right\"))\n    base[\"eternitude_persistence\"] = eternitude_persistence(pr, ks_u)\n    return base\n\ndef compute_metrics_from_path(path: str) -> dict:\n    rec = load_record(path)\n    return compute_metrics_from_record(rec)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
