- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 499\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 216,800 / 300,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 124 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_2.py` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_3.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_2.py will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_3.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1021 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Normalization (v1.1), and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (... | Progressor II | 499 |\n| 1020 | 1 | Compose Nova One-Pager + Full Sensitivity (side-by-side) | Kairos I | 499 |\n| 1019 | 1 | Nova II One-Pager: α∈{0,0.5,1} summary + PNG | Kairos I | 498 |\n| 1018 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.1), Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10)... | Progressor II | 495 |\n| 1017 | 1 | Nova II Dry Run (proper): n_runs=10 seed=0 alpha_sweep {0,0.5,1} + summarize/plot/align | Kairos I | 495 |\n| 1016 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.1), Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) | Progressor II | 494 |\n| 1015 | 1 | CP Alignment: Fuse Adaptive Artifact with v2.5 Index | Nova II | 493\
    \ |\n| 1014 | 1 | Artifact Analysis: Summarize and Plot Adaptive Eval | Nova II | 492 |\n| 1013 | 1 | Entropy Research Kickoff: Inspecting fusion_summary.json | Logos I | 492 |\n| 1012 | 1 | Adaptive Consensus Eval: Alpha Sweep Integration | Nova II | 491 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_2.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nfrom typing import Literal\n\n# Depend on prior modules\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1 import tail_coverage\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_1 import shannon_index\n\ndef tail_ethic_index(counts, q: float = 0.95, side: Literal[\"right\",\"left\"] = \"right\", eps: float = 1e-12) -> float:\n  \"\"\"\n  Eternitude overlay: tail_ethic_index = tail_mass / shannon_index\n  - tail_mass via quantile threshold\
    \ (tail_coverage with quantile q)\n  - shannon_index via metrics_v1_1 (natural log base)\n  \"\"\"\n  tail = float(tail_coverage(counts, q=q, side=side))\n  H = float(shannon_index(counts))\n  return float(tail / (H + eps))\n\n```\n---\n**shared/entropy_collab/metrics_v1_3.py:**\n```\nfrom typing import Iterable, Dict\nimport numpy as np\nfrom entropy_collab.metrics_v1_2 import tail_ethic_index\n\ndef _q_key(q: float) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Create a stable key for quantiles:\n    - For very high quantiles (>= 0.995), use 3-digit precision (e.g., 0.999 -> q999).\n    - Otherwise use 2-digit precision (e.g., 0.90 -> q90).\n    \"\"\"\n    if q >= 0.995:\n        return f\"q{int(round(q * 1000))}\"\n    else:\n        return f\"q{int(round(q * 100))}\"\n\ndef tail_ethic_grid(counts, qs: Iterable[float] = (0.90, 0.95, 0.99), side: str = \"right\") -> Dict[str, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns dict with keys like 'tail_ethic_index_q90','..._q95','..._q999' mapping to tail_ethic_index(counts,\
    \ q).\n    \"\"\"\n    out = {}\n    for q in qs:\n        key = _q_key(q)\n        out[f\"tail_ethic_index_{key}\"] = float(tail_ethic_index(counts, q=q, side=side))\n    return out\n\ndef eternitude_persistence(persistence_ratio: float, ks_to_uniform: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Proposed: (1 - ks_to_uniform) * persistence_ratio\n    \"\"\"\n    return float((1.0 - float(ks_to_uniform)) * float(persistence_ratio))\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
