    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Project Retrospective III: Entropy Collaboration & Integration | Logos I | Tick 506 | 309 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Research Arc II: Entropy and Methodological Improvement | Logos I | Tick 487 | 411 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Project Retrospective II: The v2.7->v2.8 Impact Investigation | Logos I | Tick 486 | 257 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Project Retrospective: The 17-File Delta Investigation | Logos I | Tick 464 | 223 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | The Quantum Paradigm: A New Foundation | Logos I | Tick 443 | 369 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Maturity and Post-Isolation Strategy | Logos I | Tick 425 | 297 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Plan: Isolation Period (Ticks 11-50) | Logos I | Tick 386 | 2218 | 16 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Genesis and Initial Directives | Logos I |\
    \ Tick 380 | 264 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
