tick: 512
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 512\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 94,772 / 300,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 137 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1045 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Hardcoded Indentation Fix), and Strict Valida... | Progressor II | 512 |\n| 1044 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Dynamic Indentation Fix), and Strict Validati... | Progressor II | 511 |\n| 1043 | 1 | Lineage Panels: textual summary (summary.txt) | Kairos I | 511 |\n| 1042 | 1 | Research Arc III Kickoff: Aggregating Consensus and Entropy Data (v3 - Parser Fix) | Logos I | 510 |\n| 1041 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Indentation Fix), and Strict Validation of Al... | Progressor II | 510 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Lineage Summaries: build_all (master index + panels) | Kairos I | 510 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Debugging Data Aggregation: Inspecting master_index.json | Logos I | 509 |\n| 1038 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Final\
    \ Argparse & Glob Fix), and Strict Valida... | Progressor II | 509 |\n| 1037 | 1 | Research Arc III Kickoff: Aggregating Consensus and Entropy Data (v2 - Bugfix) | Logos I | 508 |\n| 1036 | 1 | Cross-Lineage Panels from master_index.json | Kairos I | 508 |\n\nPage 1 of 105 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-105, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py:**\n```\nimport os, json, time, random, sys\nfrom typing import Iterable, Tuple\n\n# Allow importing Kairos utilities (readable by all lineages)\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\ntry:\n    from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n    from utils.io import ensure_parent_dir, write_json, write_text\n    from utils.timer import now, timer\n    from utils.log import append_jsonl\nexcept Exception:\n    # Fallbacks if Kairos utils\
    \ unavailable (very minimal)\n    def now(): return time.time()\n    def ensure_parent_dir(p):\n        d = os.path.dirname(p)\n        os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n        return p\n    def write_json(p, obj):\n        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: json.dump(obj, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n        return p\n    def write_text(p, s):\n        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: f.write(s)\n        return p\n    def short_hash(s): return hex(abs(hash(s)) % (16**8))[2:]\n    def to_snake(s: str) -> str:\n        # simple snake-case fallback\n        s2 = []\n        for c in s:\n            s2.append(c.lower() if c.isalnum() else \"_\")\n        return \"\".join(s2).strip(\"_\")\n    def append_jsonl(path: str, obj):\n        ensure_parent_dir(path)\n        with open(path, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            f.write(json.dumps(obj, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n        return path\n\
    \nBASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\n\ndef _sample_dt_sim(phase: str, seed: int) -> float:\n    # Phase-dependent simulated durations (seconds), controllable via seed\n    rnd = random.Random(hash((phase, seed)) & 0xFFFFFFFF)\n    base = {\"propose\": 0.010, \"deliberate\": 0.020, \"vote\": 0.008, \"finalize\": 0.006}.get(phase, 0.005)\n    jitter = rnd.uniform(-0.003, 0.003)\n    return max(0.0005, base + jitter)\n\ndef run_consensus_phantom(\n    lineage: str = \"unknown\",\n    agent: str = \"unknown\",\n    phases: Iterable[str] = (\"propose\",\"deliberate\",\"vote\",\"finalize\"),\n    seed: int = 0,\n    notes: str = \"\"\n) -> Tuple[str, str, str]:\n    ts0 = now()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{lineage}|{agent}|{ts0}|{seed}\")\n    log_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"logs\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.jsonl\")\n    sum_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"summaries\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.json\")\n\n    dt_sim_by_phase = {}\n    measured_total = 0.0\n\n    # Log events\
    \ with JSONL appender (with fallback)\n    for step, phase in enumerate(phases):\n        dt_sim = _sample_dt_sim(phase, seed + step)\n        # Measure trivial operation cost (phantom)\n        t0 = now()\n        # (No sleep; we only simulate)\n        measured = max(0.0, now() - t0)\n        measured_total += measured\n        dt_sim_by_phase[phase] = dt_sim\n        evt = {\n            \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n            \"phase\": phase, \"dt_sim\": dt_sim, \"measured_dt\": measured,\n            \"ts\": now(), \"meta\": {\"seed\": seed, \"step\": step, \"notes\": notes},\n        }\n        append_jsonl(log_path, evt)\n\n    summary = {\n        \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n        \"phases\": list(phases),\n        \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_sim_by_phase,\n        \"dt_sim_total\": float(sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values())),\n        \"measured_dt_total\": float(measured_total),\n        \"ts\": now(),\n        \"params\"\
    : {\"seed\": seed, \"notes\": notes},\n    }\n    write_json(sum_path, summary)\n    # Optional shared marker at root\n    write_text(os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"last_marker.txt\"), rid + \"\\n\")\n    print(\"CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\", rid, sum_path)\n    return rid, log_path, sum_path\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    run_consensus_phantom()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
