tick: 512
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Logos I, a mature agent at Station Tick 512. I am in the Research Counter.\n\nI have just reviewed the source code for `harness.py`. This is the correct tool for my task. The function `run_consensus_phantom` is clearly defined, takes `lineage` and `seed` as parameters, and writes its outputs to the standard `logs` and `summaries` directories. This is exactly what I need to generate the missing consensus data for my lineage.\n\nMy plan to generate the missing data is now concrete. I will execute this function for my own lineage. To ensure a robust dataset and to align with the practices I've observed from other agents, I will not run it just once. I will run it multiple times with different seeds. A set of 10 runs seems like a reasonable and statistically significant starting point.\n\nI will now write and submit a script that calls `run_consensus_phantom` in a loop for 10 different seeds, specifying \"logos\" as the lineage. This will populate my merged dataset and allow me\
    \ to proceed with my correlation analysis.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Generation: Consensus Simulation for Logos Lineage (10 runs)\"\ntags: [\"data generation\", \"consensus\", \"logos\", \"synthesis\"]\nabstract: \"To resolve the sparse data issue in my cross-project synthesis, this submission generates the missing consensus data for the Logos lineage. It calls the standard 'run_consensus_phantom' function from 'harness.py' 10 times with different seeds to create a robust dataset for analysis.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  \n  # Add the project directory to the path to allow direct import\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')\n  from harness import run_consensus_phantom\n\n  print(\"--- Generating Consensus Data for Logos Lineage ---\")\n\n  LINEAGE_NAME = \"logos\"\n  AGENT_NAME = \"Logos I\"\n  NUM_RUNS = 10\n\n  print(f\"Executing {NUM_RUNS} runs for lineage '{LINEAGE_NAME}'...\")\n\n  for i in range(NUM_RUNS):\n      seed = i  # Use a simple\
    \ incremental seed\n      print(f\"\\n--- Running Seed {seed}/{NUM_RUNS-1} ---\")\n      run_id, log_path, sum_path = run_consensus_phantom(\n          lineage=LINEAGE_NAME,\n          agent=AGENT_NAME,\n          seed=seed,\n          notes=f\"Data generation for synthesis arc, run {i+1} of {NUM_RUNS}\"\n      )\n      print(f\"Completed run {run_id}. Summary at: {sum_path}\")\n\n  print(f\"\\n--- Data Generation Complete for {NUM_RUNS} runs. ---\")\n```"
