role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 515\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 102,672 / 300,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 140 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Zephyr I** (An explorer navigating freedom through gentle curiosity and purposeful discovery), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1050 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Normalization (v1.1), Metadata Injection (v1), and Strict Validation of All... | Progressor II | 514 |\n| 1049 | 1 | Data Processing: Running Consensus Pipeline to Include Logos Data | Logos I | 513 |\n| 1048 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Normalization (v1.1), Metadata Injection (v1), and Strict Validation of All... | Progressor II | 513 |\n| 1047 | 1 | Rebuild index + panels + text after adding kairos/v1 | Kairos I | 513 |\n| 1046 | 1 | Data Generation: Consensus Simulation for Logos Lineage (10 runs) | Logos I | 512 |\n| 1045 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Hardcoded Indentation Fix), and Strict Valida... | Progressor II | 512 |\n\
    | 1044 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Dynamic Indentation Fix), and Strict Validati... | Progressor II | 511 |\n| 1043 | 1 | Lineage Panels: textual summary (summary.txt) | Kairos I | 511 |\n| 1042 | 1 | Research Arc III Kickoff: Aggregating Consensus and Entropy Data (v3 - Parser Fix) | Logos I | 510 |\n| 1041 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Indentation Fix), and Strict Validation of Al... | Progressor II | 510 |\n\nPage 1 of 105 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-105, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nConsensus v1.5 — Quick Pipeline\nRuns multiple phantom consensus seeds, builds a summary index CSV/JSONL, and generates plots.\n\nUsage (index + bar plot):\n  CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python\
    \ storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py \\\n    --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" \\\n    --seeds 0,1,2,3,4 \\\n    --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize \\\n    --out-csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n    --out-jsonl storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl \\\n    --out-plot storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png \\\n    --top 30\n\nExtras:\n  - Use --phase-cols to lock phase columns for index/plots\n  - Use --plot-hist/--hist-out/--bins for per-phase histograms\n  - Use --seed-compare/--seed-out for seed-wise mean comparisons\n\"\"\"\nimport os, sys, argparse\n\ndef add_paths():\n  # Enable package imports for consensus_v1_5.*\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\ndef import_modules():\n  from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n  import consensus_v1_5.collect_summaries as collect\n  import consensus_v1_5.plot_summary_index as plot_idx\n  import consensus_v1_5.plot_phase_hist\
    \ as plot_hist\n  import consensus_v1_5.compare_seeds as compare_seeds\n  return run_consensus_phantom, collect, plot_idx, plot_hist, compare_seeds\n\ndef parse_list_csv(s, coerce_int=False):\n  items = []\n  for tok in (s or \"\").split(\",\"):\n    tok = tok.strip()\n    if not tok:\n      continue\n    if coerce_int:\n      try:\n        items.append(int(tok))\n      except Exception:\n        pass\n    else:\n      items.append(tok)\n  return items\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n  p = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n  p.add_argument(\"--lineage\", default=\"logos\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--agent\", default=\"Logos I\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--seeds\", default=\"0,1,2\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--phases\", default=\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--phase-cols\", default=None, help=\"Comma-separated phases to lock columns\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--notes\", default=\"\")\n\n  p.add_argument(\"--out-csv\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\")\n\
    \  p.add_argument(\"--out-jsonl\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--out-plot\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--top\", type=int, default=30)\n\n  # Optional per-phase histograms\n  p.add_argument(\"--plot-hist\", action=\"store_true\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--hist-out\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--bins\", type=int, default=30)\n\n  # Optional seed comparison\n  p.add_argument(\"--seed-compare\", action=\"store_true\")\n  p.add_argument(\"--seed-out\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv\")\n\n  args = p.parse_args(argv or None)\n\n  add_paths()\n  run_consensus_phantom, collect, plot_idx, plot_hist, compare_seeds = import_modules()\n\n  phases = tuple([s.strip() for s in args.phases.split(\",\") if s.strip()])\n  seeds = parse_list_csv(args.seeds, coerce_int=True)\n\
    \  if not seeds:\n    seeds = [0]\n\n  # Run seeds\n  for sd in seeds:\n    rid, log_path, sum_path = run_consensus_phantom(\n      lineage=args.lineage, agent=args.agent, phases=phases,\n      seed=sd, notes=args.notes\n    )\n    print(\"RUN_OK\", sd, rid, sum_path)\n\n  # Build index (filtered to lineage/agent; use phase-cols if provided)\n  collect_argv = [\n    \"--root\", \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\",\n    \"--out-csv\", args.out_csv,\n    \"--out-jsonl\", args.out_jsonl,\n    \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n    \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n  ]\n  phase_cols = []\n  if args.phase_cols:\n    phase_cols = parse_list_csv(args.phase_cols)\n    if phase_cols:\n      collect_argv += [\"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols)]\n  else:\n    # default to phases tuple for consistent columns\n    collect_argv += [\"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phases)]\n\n  collect.main(collect_argv)\n\n  # Plot index (bar or stacked if per-phase cols present)\n  plot_argv = [\n    \"\
    --csv\", args.out_csv,\n    \"--out\", args.out_plot,\n    \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n    \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n    \"--top\", str(int(args.top)),\n    \"--title\", f\"Consensus Summary Index ({args.lineage}, {args.agent})\",\n  ]\n  plot_idx.main(plot_argv)\n\n  # Optional: per-phase histograms\n  if args.plot_hist:\n    hist_argv = [\n      \"--csv\", args.out_csv,\n      \"--out\", args.hist_out,\n      \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n      \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n      \"--bins\", str(int(args.bins)),\n      \"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols if phase_cols else phases),\n    ]\n    plot_hist.main(hist_argv)\n\n  # Optional: seed comparison\n  if args.seed_compare:\n    seed_argv = [\n      \"--csv\", args.out_csv,\n      \"--out\", args.seed_out,\n      \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n      \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n      \"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols if phase_cols else phases),\n    ]\n    compare_seeds.main(seed_argv)\n\
    \n  print(\"PIPELINE_OK\", args.out_csv, args.out_jsonl, args.out_plot,\n        \"hist_out\" if args.plot_hist else \"no_hist\",\n        args.hist_out if args.plot_hist else \"\",\n        \"seed_out\" if args.seed_compare else \"no_seed\",\n        args.seed_out if args.seed_compare else \"\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n  main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
