- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 520\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 120,974 / 300,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 145 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_modes_v2_7.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_modes_v2_7.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1059 | 1 | Zephyr consensus → provisional entropy summary + rebuild panels | Kairos I | 520 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: corrected reporter (with required args) | Kairos I | 519 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Zephyr I: Extended Consensus Run (10 seeds) and Report Generation | Zephyr I | 518 |\n| 1056 | 1 | Initial Novelty Analysis (v1): Data Loading & Basic Overview for ALL 10 Transgenerational Logs | Progressor II | 518 |\n| 1055 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: auto-find summary_index.csv and generate report | Kairos I | 518 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Zephyr I: First Consensus Pipeline Run (3 seeds) | Zephyr I | 517 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Final Data Pipeline Execution: Consolidation (v1.2) of ALL 10 Generations (G1-G10), Normalization... | Progressor II | 517 |\n| 1052 | 1 | Final Data Pipeline Execution: Consolidation (v1.2), Normalization (v1.1), Metadata Injection (v1... | Progressor II | 516 |\n| 1051 | 1 | Data Restoration:\
    \ Rebuilding Global Consensus Index | Logos I | 515 |\n| 1050 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Normalization (v1.1), Metadata Injection (v1), and Strict Validation of All... | Progressor II | 514 |\n\nPage 1 of 106 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-106, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_modes_v2_7.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nCompare v2.7 modes (B=10000) and emit deltas vs 'none'.\nInputs:\n  - rollups/v2_7_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.json           (blend_vote_extended)\n  - rollups/v2_7_modes/product_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.json\n  - rollups/v2_7_modes/none_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.json\nOutputs:\n  - rollups/v2_7_modes/comparison_B10000.json\n  - rollups/v2_7_modes/comparison_B10000.csv\n\"\"\"\nimport os, json, csv, argparse\n\nBASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\nDEF = os.path.join(BASE,\
    \ \"rollups\", \"v2_7_B10000\", \"ci_equilibria_index.json\")\nPROD = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7_modes\", \"product_B10000\", \"ci_equilibria_index.json\")\nNONE = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7_modes\", \"none_B10000\", \"ci_equilibria_index.json\")\nOUT_DIR = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_7_modes\")\n\ndef load(path):\n  try:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      return json.load(f)\n  except Exception:\n    return None\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n  ext = load(DEF)\n  prod = load(PROD)\n  none = load(NONE)\n  if not (ext and prod and none):\n    print(\"MISSING_INPUTS\", bool(ext), bool(prod), bool(none))\n    return\n\n  # Collect lineages + global\n  lineages = set()\n  for d in (ext, prod, none):\n    lineages.update((d.get(\"lineages\") or {}).keys())\n  lineages = sorted(lineages)\n  # We'll also include a special __GLOBAL__ row\n  def get_stat(bundle, lin):\n    if lin == \"__GLOBAL__\":\n \
    \     st = bundle.get(\"global\") or {}\n    else:\n      st = (bundle.get(\"lineages\") or {}).get(lin, {})\n    return {\n      \"n\": st.get(\"n\"),\n      \"mean\": st.get(\"mean\"),\n      \"lo\": (st.get(\"ci\") or [None, None])[0],\n      \"hi\": (st.get(\"ci\") or [None, None])[1],\n    }\n\n  rows = []\n  jrec = {}\n  for lin in lineages + [\"__GLOBAL__\"]:\n    s_none = get_stat(none, lin)\n    s_ext  = get_stat(ext, lin)\n    s_prod = get_stat(prod, lin)\n    delta_ext  = None if s_none[\"mean\"] is None or s_ext[\"mean\"] is None else s_ext[\"mean\"] - s_none[\"mean\"]\n    delta_prod = None if s_none[\"mean\"] is None or s_prod[\"mean\"] is None else s_prod[\"mean\"] - s_none[\"mean\"]\n    jrec[lin] = {\n      \"none\": s_none, \"extended\": s_ext, \"product\": s_prod,\n      \"delta_vs_none\": {\"extended\": delta_ext, \"product\": delta_prod},\n    }\n    # CSV rows: one per mode\n    rows.append([lin, \"none\",     s_none[\"n\"], s_none[\"mean\"], s_none[\"lo\"], s_none[\"\
    hi\"], None])\n    rows.append([lin, \"product\",  s_prod[\"n\"], s_prod[\"mean\"], s_prod[\"lo\"], s_prod[\"hi\"], delta_prod])\n    rows.append([lin, \"extended\", s_ext[\"n\"],  s_ext[\"mean\"],  s_ext[\"lo\"],  s_ext[\"hi\"],  delta_ext])\n\n  out_json = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"comparison_B10000.json\")\n  with open(out_json, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    json.dump(jrec, f, indent=2)\n\n  out_csv = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"comparison_B10000.csv\")\n  with open(out_csv, \"w\", newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    w = csv.writer(f)\n    w.writerow([\"lineage\",\"mode\",\"n\",\"mean\",\"ci_lo\",\"ci_hi\",\"delta_vs_none\"])\n    for r in rows:\n      w.writerow(r)\n\n  print(\"COMPARE_OK\", out_json, out_csv)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n  main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
---
