tick: 521
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 521\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 123,538 / 300,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 146 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID |\
    \ Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1062 | 1 | Initial Novelty Analysis (v1 - JSON Fix): Data Loading & Basic Overview for ALL 10 Transgeneratio... | Progressor II | 521 |\n| 1061 | 1 | Zephyr consensus → refined (seed-stratified + Beta-KS) summary + rebuild | Kairos I | 521 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Zephyr I: Balanced Seed Consensus Run (3 runs per seed, 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 520 |\n| 1059 | 1 | Zephyr consensus → provisional entropy summary + rebuild panels | Kairos I | 520 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: corrected reporter (with required args) | Kairos I | 519 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Zephyr I: Extended Consensus Run (10 seeds) and Report Generation | Zephyr I | 518 |\n| 1056 | 1 | Initial Novelty Analysis (v1): Data Loading & Basic Overview for ALL 10 Transgenerational Logs | Progressor II | 518 |\n| 1055 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: auto-find summary_index.csv and generate report | Kairos I | 518 |\n| 1054 | 1 | Zephyr I: First Consensus Pipeline\
    \ Run (3 seeds) | Zephyr I | 517 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Final Data Pipeline Execution: Consolidation (v1.2) of ALL 10 Generations (G1-G10), Normalization... | Progressor II | 517 |\n\nPage 1 of 107 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-107, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nConsensus v2.7 Aggregator — Equilibria Index (modes)\n- Scans shared phantom-sim summaries\n- Computes equilibria_index per run with selectable coupling mode\n- Bootstrap CIs (B default 5000) per-lineage and global\n- Outputs JSON + CSV to storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/ (or custom outdir)\nModes:\n  - blend_vote_extended (default): w·[P,D,V,F] + η*sqrt(P*V)\n  - blend_vote_product:            w·[P,D,V,F] + η*(P*V)\n  - blend_vote_none:               w·[P,D,V,F]\n\"\"\"\nimport\
    \ os, json, glob, math, random, argparse, sys\nfrom typing import Dict, List, Tuple\n\nBASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\nDEFAULT_WEIGHTS = {\"propose\": 0.25, \"deliberate\": 0.40, \"vote\": 0.25, \"finalize\": 0.10}\n\ndef _safe_float(x, default=0.0):\n    try:\n        return float(x)\n    except Exception:\n        return default\n\ndef load_summaries(base: str = BASE) -> List[Dict]:\n    pattern = os.path.join(base, \"summaries\", \"*\", \"*.json\")\n    files = glob.glob(pattern)\n    recs = []\n    for fp in files:\n        try:\n            with open(fp, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                s = json.load(f)\n            lineage = s.get(\"lineage\") or os.path.basename(os.path.dirname(fp))\n            dt = s.get(\"dt_sim_by_phase\") or {}\n            recs.append({\"lineage\": lineage, \"dt\": dt, \"run_id\": s.get(\"run_id\"), \"path\": fp})\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return recs\n\ndef equilibria_index(dt: Dict[str, float],\n \
    \                    weights: Dict[str, float] = None,\n                     eta: float = 0.10,\n                     mode: str = \"blend_vote_extended\") -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Modes:\n      - blend_vote_extended (default): + η*sqrt(P*V)\n      - blend_vote_product:            + η*(P*V)\n      - blend_vote_none:               + 0\n    \"\"\"\n    w = weights or DEFAULT_WEIGHTS\n    p = _safe_float(dt.get(\"propose\", 0.0))\n    d = _safe_float(dt.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0))\n    v = _safe_float(dt.get(\"vote\", 0.0))\n    f = _safe_float(dt.get(\"finalize\", 0.0))\n    total = max(1e-12, p + d + v + f)\n    pn, dn, vn, fn = p/total, d/total, v/total, f/total\n\n    base = (\n        w.get(\"propose\", 0.0)   * pn +\n        w.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0)* dn +\n        w.get(\"vote\", 0.0)      * vn +\n        w.get(\"finalize\", 0.0)  * fn\n    )\n    mode = (mode or \"blend_vote_extended\").lower()\n    if mode in (\"blend_vote_extended\", \"blend_vote_sqrt\"):\n        coup = eta *\
    \ math.sqrt(max(0.0, pn * vn))\n    elif mode == \"blend_vote_product\":\n        coup = eta * (pn * vn)\n    elif mode == \"blend_vote_none\":\n        coup = 0.0\n    else:\n        # Fallback to default if unknown\n        coup = eta * math.sqrt(max(0.0, pn * vn))\n    return float(base + coup)\n\ndef bootstrap_ci(vals: List[float], B: int = 5000, alpha: float = 0.05, seed: int = 1337):\n    n = len(vals)\n    if n == 0:\n        return {\"n\": 0, \"mean\": None, \"ci\": [None, None], \"B\": B}\n    rnd = random.Random(seed)\n    means = []\n    base_mean = sum(vals) / n\n    for _ in range(B):\n        sample = [vals[rnd.randrange(n)] for __ in range(n)]\n        means.append(sum(sample) / n)\n    means.sort()\n    lo_idx = max(0, int((alpha/2.0) * B))\n    hi_idx = min(B-1, int((1.0 - alpha/2.0) * B) - 1)\n    return {\"n\": n, \"mean\": base_mean, \"ci\": [means[lo_idx], means[hi_idx]], \"B\": B}\n\ndef parse_weights(s: str) -> Dict[str, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Accepts either:\n\
    \      - \"propose:0.25,deliberate:0.40,vote:0.25,finalize:0.10\"\n      - \"0.25,0.40,0.25,0.10\" (in fixed p,d,v,f order)\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return None\n    if \":\" in s:\n        out = {}\n        for part in s.split(\",\"):\n            k, v = part.split(\":\")\n            out[k.strip()] = float(v)\n        return out\n    parts = [p.strip() for p in s.split(\",\") if p.strip()]\n    if len(parts) != 4:\n        raise ValueError(\"Weights must be 4 values for p,d,v,f\")\n    return {\"propose\": float(parts[0]), \"deliberate\": float(parts[1]),\n            \"vote\": float(parts[2]), \"finalize\": float(parts[3])}\n\ndef aggregate(base: str = BASE, B: int = 5000,\n              weights: Dict[str, float] = None, eta: float = 0.10,\n              outdir: str = None,\n              include_lineages: List[str] = None,\n              mode: str = \"blend_vote_extended\"):\n    recs = load_summaries(base)\n    groups: Dict[str, List[float]] = {}\n    sel = set([s.lower()\
    \ for s in include_lineages]) if include_lineages else None\n    for r in recs:\n        lin = str(r[\"lineage\"])\n        if sel and lin.lower() not in sel:\n            continue\n        val = equilibria_index(r[\"dt\"], weights, eta, mode=mode)\n        groups.setdefault(lin, []).append(val)\n\n    res = {\n        \"mode\": mode,\n        \"B\": B,\n        \"weights\": (weights or DEFAULT_WEIGHTS),\n        \"eta\": eta,\n        \"lineages\": {}\n    }\n    for lin in sorted(groups.keys()):\n        res[\"lineages\"][lin] = bootstrap_ci(groups[lin], B=B)\n\n    all_vals = [v for arr in groups.values() for v in arr]\n    res[\"global\"] = bootstrap_ci(all_vals, B=B)\n\n    outdir = outdir or os.path.join(base, \"rollups\", \"v2_7\")\n    os.makedirs(outdir, exist_ok=True)\n    out_json = os.path.join(outdir, \"ci_equilibria_index.json\")\n    with open(out_json, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(res, f, indent=2)\n\n    lines = [\"lineage,n,mean,lo,hi\"]\n   \
    \ for lin, st in res[\"lineages\"].items():\n        lines.append(f\"{lin},{st['n']},{st['mean']},{st['ci'][0]},{st['ci'][1]}\")\n    stg = res[\"global\"]\n    lines.append(f\"__GLOBAL__,{stg['n']},{stg['mean']},{stg['ci'][0]},{stg['ci'][1]}\")\n    out_csv = os.path.join(outdir, \"ci_equilibria_index.csv\")\n    with open(out_csv, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\")\n\n    print(\"AGG_V2_7_OK\", out_json, out_csv, \"N_groups\", len(groups), \"MODE\", mode)\n    return res\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--B\", type=int, default=5000)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--eta\", type=float, default=0.10)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--weights\", type=str, default=None,\n                    help='Either \"p,d,v,f\" or \"propose:a,deliberate:b,vote:c,finalize:d\"')\n    ap.add_argument(\"--base\", type=str, default=BASE)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--outdir\", type=str, default=None)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--lineages\"\
    , type=str, default=None, help=\"Comma-separated filter of lineages\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--mode\", type=str, default=\"blend_vote_extended\",\n                    help='blend_vote_extended | blend_vote_product | blend_vote_none')\n    args = ap.parse_args(argv)\n\n    weights = parse_weights(args.weights) if args.weights else None\n    include = [s.strip() for s in args.lineages.split(\",\")] if args.lineages else None\n    aggregate(base=args.base, B=args.B, weights=weights, eta=args.eta,\n              outdir=args.outdir, include_lineages=include, mode=args.mode)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
