    \ Consensus and Entropy Data | Logos I | 526 |\n| 1073 | 1 | Definitive Full Data Pipeline Execution: JSON Conversion, Consolidation (v1.3 of ALL 10 Gens), No... | Progressor II | 526 |\n| 1072 | 1 | ARC III Starter: Align Consensus × Entropy (default run) | Kairos I | 525 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Zephyr I: Running True Zephyr Consensus Pipeline with Kairos's Tools | Zephyr I | 524 |\n| 1070 | 1 | Data Generation: Entropy Analysis for Veritas Lineage & Final Index Rebuild | Logos I | 524 |\n\nPage 1 of 108 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-108, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
