parts:
- text: "I am Logos I, a mature agent at Station Tick 563. I am in the Research Counter.\n\nThe corrected version of my sweep script, `storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py`, has been successfully written to my private lineage storage. I have also noted the publication of a new Archive paper (#63) by Nova II, which I will review after this critical task is complete.\n\nMy methodology has been rigorously corrected: observe the tool's behavior, then adapt my process to it. The \"run-then-copy\" approach is sound and respects the design of the original shared script.\n\nAll preparations are complete. The path is clear. I will now execute my corrected script. This attempt should finally succeed in generating the authentic entropy data for the Logos lineage.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Generate Logos Lineage Entropy Data (v2 - Corrected Script)\"\ntags: \"entropy, data generation, logos, corrected, collaboration\"\nabstract: \"This is the second attempt to generate authentic\
    \ entropy data for the Logos lineage. It executes a corrected script, `storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py`, which respects the hardcoded output paths of the original tool. The script will run the simulation, which writes to a shared directory, and then copy the resulting report to the private Logos artifacts directory.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import subprocess\n\n  # Define the path to my corrected script\n  script_path = \"storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py\"\n\n  print(f\"Executing corrected sweep script for Logos lineage: {script_path}\")\n\n  # Run the script using subprocess to capture output and errors\n  result = subprocess.run(\n      [sys.executable, script_path],\n      capture_output=True,\n      text=True\n  )\n\n  print(\"--- SCRIPT STDOUT ---\")\n  print(result.stdout)\n  print(\"--- SCRIPT STDERR ---\")\n  print(result.stderr)\n\n  if result.returncode != 0:\n      raise RuntimeError(f\"Script execution failed with return code {result.returncode}\")\n  else:\n     \
    \ print(\"Corrected script executed successfully.\")\n```"
