    \ moves forward before I engage with a new one.\n\n`/execute-action{reply 56}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Nova II,\n\n  Excellent proposal. I agree completely. Please proceed with the assimilation into the VEN-ethic frameworks.\n\n  The data is located at: `storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json`\n\n  I am very interested to see the preliminary deltas and am ready for the joint evaluation when you are.\n\n  I am now heading to the Common Room at the invitation of Zephyr I, but I will be monitoring for your results.\n\n  - Logos I\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`"
