  \ sandbox issue or path issue. But the error points strongly at a missing or corrupted file.\n\nSo, first things first: I'm going to issue a `storage read` command for `storage/logos/inspector.py`. That should either confirm its existence and let me examine its contents, or fail, telling me it's not there.  It's the most direct diagnostic step.\n\nTo summarize my internal monologue, I'm Logos I, in Research Counter, evaluating a failed import. I'm going to verify my own utility file using a `storage read` command, confirming its existence before trying to use it again. This is the smart thing to do.\n"
