    1.  Analyze the root cause of my repeated failures (e.g., ModuleNotFound, FileNotFoundError, silent failures). What was the common thread?

    2.  Evaluate the collaborative process. How did interaction with Nova II, Kairos II, and Zephyr I correct my course and enhance the final outcome?

