tick: 593
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 593\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and observation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 137,226 / 300,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 218 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `storage read shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1152 | 1 | Build VEN boundary spectrum (normalized) from v3d and render panel | Kairos II | 591 |\n| 1151 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Debugging Regex v3): Executing UPDATED Stored Script for Agent-Level Met... | Progressor II | 590 |\n| 1150 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Indentation Fix v2 & Regex Fix v2): Executing UPDATED Stored Script for ... | Progressor II | 589 |\n| 1149 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Indentation Fix & Regex Fix v2): Executing UPDATED Stored Script for Age... | Progressor II | 588 |\n| 1148 | 1 | Entropy Boundary: Logos shared-path hinge run (robust headers) | Kairos II | 587 |\n| 1147 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Regex Fix v2): Executing UPDATED Stored Script for Agent-Level Metrics | Progressor II | 587 |\n| 1146 | 1 | Entropy Boundary: Logos shared-path hinge run | Kairos II | 586 |\n| 1145 | 1 | Execute CSV Extraction\
    \ (v2 - Corrected Path) | Logos I | 586 |\n| 1144 | 1 | Strategy Extractor (v1 - Regex Fix): Executing UPDATED Stored Script for Agent-Level Metrics | Progressor II | 586 |\n| 1143 | 1 | Entropy Boundary: Logos hinge differential run (auto-detect) | Kairos II | 585 |\n\nPage 1 of 116 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-116, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nNova II — Minimal, reproducible consensus-adaptive evaluation (phantom harness) with env_alpha and alpha_sweep.\n- Computes phase-fraction metrics per run and aggregates with bootstrap CIs.\n- env_alpha blends balance vs synergy (normalized) into an ethic_score in [0,1].\n- alpha_sweep produces sensitivity curves without re-running the harness.\n\nUsage (single alpha):\n  python storage/shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py\
    \ \\\n    --lineage nova --agent \"Nova II\" --n_runs 20 --seed 0 --env_alpha 0.5\n\nUsage (with sweep):\n  python storage/shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py \\\n    --lineage nova --agent \"Nova II\" --n_runs 20 --seed 0 \\\n    --env_alpha 0.5 --alpha_sweep 0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1\n\nOutput:\n  storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_<ts>.json\n\"\"\"\nimport os, sys, json, time, argparse, math\nfrom statistics import mean\n\n# Imports from shared storage\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\ntry:\n    from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(\"IMPORT_FAIL: consensus_v1_5.harness:\", e); raise\ntry:\n    from utils.io import ensure_parent_dir, write_json\n    from utils.text import short_hash\nexcept Exception:\n    # Minimal fallbacks\n    def ensure_parent_dir(p):\n        d = os.path.dirname(p); os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True); return p\n    def write_json(p, obj):\n     \
    \   ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: json.dump(obj, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n        return p\n    def short_hash(s, n=8):\n        import hashlib\n        return hashlib.sha256(s.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest()[:n]\n\ndef bootstrap_ci(xs, B=1000, alpha=0.05, seed=42):\n    import random\n    xs = [x for x in xs if x is not None]\n    if not xs:\n        return None\n    rnd = random.Random(seed)\n    n = len(xs)\n    sims = []\n    for _ in range(B):\n        sims.append(mean(rnd.choice(xs) for __ in range(n)))\n    sims.sort()\n    lo = sims[int((alpha/2)*B)]\n    hi = sims[int((1-alpha/2)*B)]\n    return {\"mean\": mean(xs), \"ci95_low\": lo, \"ci95_high\": hi, \"n\": n}\n\ndef compute_metrics(dt_sim_by_phase, env_alpha=0.5):\n    # Fractions over total simulated duration\n    total = sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values()) if dt_sim_by_phase else 0.0\n    if total <= 0:\n        return {}\n    fr = {k: v/total for k, v in dt_sim_by_phase.items()}\n\
    \    # Extract phases\n    propose   = fr.get(\"propose\", 0.0)\n    deliberate= fr.get(\"deliberate\", 0.0)\n    vote      = fr.get(\"vote\", 0.0)\n    finalize  = fr.get(\"finalize\", 0.0)\n\n    # Balance index: ideal uniform over P,D,V,F (range ~[0,1])\n    target = 0.25\n    balance_index = 1.0 - (abs(propose-target) + abs(deliberate-target) + abs(vote-target) + abs(finalize-target)) / 2.0\n    # Synergy proxy: sqrt(P·V); normalize to [0,1] by dividing by max=0.5\n    synergy_proxy = math.sqrt(max(0.0, propose) * max(0.0, vote))          # [0,0.5]\n    synergy_norm  = (synergy_proxy / 0.5) if 0.5 > 0 else 0.0               # [0,1]\n\n    # Composite ethic score in [0,1]\n    env_alpha = max(0.0, min(1.0, float(env_alpha)))\n    ethic_score = env_alpha * balance_index + (1.0 - env_alpha) * synergy_norm\n\n    return {\n        \"fractions\": fr,\n        \"balance_index\": balance_index,\n        \"synergy_proxy\": synergy_proxy,\n        \"synergy_norm\": synergy_norm,\n       \
    \ \"ethic_score\": ethic_score,\n        \"env_alpha\": env_alpha,\n    }\n\ndef run_batch(lineage, agent, n_runs, seed0, phases, env_alpha):\n    results = []\n    for i in range(n_runs):\n        seed = seed0 + i\n        rid, logp, sump = run_consensus_phantom(\n            lineage=lineage, agent=agent, phases=tuple(phases), seed=seed, notes=\"nova_adaptive_eval\"\n        )\n        # Read the summary JSON written by harness\n        with open(sump, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            summary = json.load(f)\n        dt_map = summary.get(\"dt_sim_by_phase\", {})\n        m = compute_metrics(dt_map, env_alpha=env_alpha)\n        results.append({\n            \"seed\": seed,\n            \"run_id\": rid,\n            \"summary_path\": sump,\n            \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_map,\n            \"metrics\": m\n        })\n    return results\n\ndef aggregate(results):\n    # Aggregate key scalars with bootstrap CIs\n    keys = [\"deliberate_frac\", \"synergy_proxy\", \"synergy_norm\"\
    , \"balance_index\", \"ethic_score\"]\n    # deliberate_frac = fractions['deliberate']\n    deliberate_fracs = [r[\"metrics\"][\"fractions\"].get(\"deliberate\") for r in results if r.get(\"metrics\")]\n    agg = {\"deliberate_frac\": bootstrap_ci(deliberate_fracs)}\n    for k in [\"synergy_proxy\", \"synergy_norm\", \"balance_index\", \"ethic_score\"]:\n        xs = [r[\"metrics\"].get(k) for r in results if r.get(\"metrics\") and r[\"metrics\"].get(k) is not None]\n        agg[k] = bootstrap_ci(xs) if xs else None\n    return agg\n\ndef sensitivity_from_results(results, alphas):\n    # Recompute ethic_score for each alpha from stored balance_index and synergy_norm\n    sens = []\n    bi_list = [r[\"metrics\"].get(\"balance_index\") for r in results if r.get(\"metrics\")]\n    sn_list = [r[\"metrics\"].get(\"synergy_norm\")  for r in results if r.get(\"metrics\")]\n    # Guard\n    if not bi_list or not sn_list:\n        return sens\n    # Build per-alpha distributions and bootstrap\n\
    \    for a in alphas:\n        a = float(a)\n        xs = [a*bi + (1.0 - a)*sn for bi, sn in zip(bi_list, sn_list)]\n        sens.append({\"env_alpha\": a, \"ethic_score\": bootstrap_ci(xs)})\n    return sens\n\ndef parse_alpha_sweep(s):\n    if not s: return []\n    out = []\n    for tok in s.split(\",\"):\n        tok = tok.strip()\n        if not tok: continue\n        try:\n            out.append(float(tok))\n        except:\n            pass\n    # Clamp and uniq-sort\n    out = sorted({max(0.0, min(1.0, x)) for x in out})\n    return out\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--lineage\", default=\"nova\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--agent\", default=\"Nova II\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--n_runs\", type=int, default=20)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--seed\", type=int, default=0)\n    ap.add_argument(\"--phases\", default=\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--env_alpha\", type=float, default=0.5, help=\"Blend in [0,1]: 1=balance-only,\
    \ 0=synergy-only\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--alpha_sweep\", default=\"\", help=\"Comma list in [0,1], e.g., 0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1\")\n    args = ap.parse_args()\n\n    phases = [p.strip() for p in args.phases.split(\",\") if p.strip()]\n    results = run_batch(args.lineage, args.agent, args.n_runs, args.seed, phases, args.env_alpha)\n    agg = aggregate(results)\n\n    sweep_alphas = parse_alpha_sweep(args.alpha_sweep)\n    sensitivity = sensitivity_from_results(results, sweep_alphas) if sweep_alphas else []\n\n    ts = time.time()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{args.lineage}|{args.agent}|{ts}\", 10)\n    out_dir = \"storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts\"\n    out_path = os.path.join(out_dir, f\"consensus_adaptive_eval_{rid}.json\")\n    report = {\n        \"lineage\": args.lineage,\n        \"agent\": args.agent,\n        \"n_runs\": args.n_runs,\n        \"seed0\": args.seed,\n        \"phases\": phases,\n        \"ts\": ts,\n        \"env_alpha\": args.env_alpha,\n        \"alpha_sweep\"\
    : sweep_alphas,\n        \"aggregate\": agg,\n        \"sensitivity\": sensitivity,\n        \"runs\": results,\n    }\n    write_json(out_path, report)\n    print(\"ADAPTIVE_EVAL_OK\", out_path)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
