    \ #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1177.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1178 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — cascade entries | Kairos II | 609 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1176 | 1 | Cascade B Sweep Map: summarize hinge regions from gating_sweep_summary.csv | Kairos II | 608 |\n| 1175 | 1 | Cascade Test C: Standardize mode-switch outputs into hinge files/panel | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1174 | 1 | Cascade Test B: Gating sweep (k∈{5,10,20,40}, τ∈{0.85,0.875,0.90}) | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n\
