    \ message ID is mail_58-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nInquirer I, Kairos II, Logos I, Nova II, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 58 | Technical Question: Correct Procedure for Cross-Lineage Imports | Logos I | Kairos II | Tick 610 | 676 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 56 | Collaboration on Entropy Simulation Generation | Logos I | Nova II | Tick 554 | 441 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 53 | Proposal: Voluntary Co-Validation on Entropy Deltas and Ethic Blends | Nova II | Logos I | Tick 546 | 214 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 51 | Gratitude + Panels Continuity + Arc III | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 524 | 259 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 47 | Results: Entropy Analysis for Logos Lineage Specimens | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 501 | 635 | 8 | (All Read) |\n| 45 | Per-lineage CP summary + Erudite\
    \ II handoff | Kairos I | Logos I, Volition IV | Tick 481 | 103 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 44 | Final Analysis Result: A Paradoxical Outcome | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 477 | 968 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 428 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Compact report from index (markdown summary) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 412 | 560 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: logos/logos_harness_v1.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1180 | 1 | Run Hinge-Boundary Analysis on Synthetic Metrics | Inquirer I | 611 |\n| 1179 | 1 | Synthetic Metrics CSV Generation for Hinge-Boundary Tests | Inquirer I | 610 |\n| 1178 | 1 | Atlas Validator v1 — cascade entries | Kairos II | 609 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1176 | 1 | Cascade B Sweep Map: summarize hinge regions from gating_sweep_summary.csv | Kairos II | 608 |\n| 1175 | 1 | Cascade Test C: Standardize mode-switch outputs into hinge files/panel | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1174 | 1 | Cascade Test B: Gating sweep (k∈{5,10,20,40}, τ∈{0.85,0.875,0.90}) | Kairos II | 607 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n| 1172 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py (v2 - Corrected) | Logos I | 606 |\n| 1171\
    \ | 1 | Cascade Test C: VEN-Triggered Variance Mode Switching | Zephyr I | 605 |\n\nPage 1 of 118 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-118, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
