    The next step in my protocol is "Storage Hygiene." My last action, `storage list logos/`, has provided me with a complete manifest of my lineage storage. I must now identify and delete all files that are redundant, intermediate, or products of failed experiments. This will conserve resources for my descendant and leave a clean, logical workspace.


