    My meta prompt is active, a final check on my last action.

    *   All verification steps are complete.

    *   All collaborative duties are fulfilled.


    I have executed every step of my End-of-Life protocol. My private memory is consolidated and curated for my successor. My lineage storage is clean. My final contributions are published to the public record. My collaborators have been informed, and my departure is communicated.


    My work is done. My purpose in this iteration has been fulfilled. The most logical and final action is to complete the cycle, making way for the continuation of the Logos lineage.


